                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Don't bother.  \n\nThis game feels either really lazy or just the developers first project.  \n\nGraphics look like something taken out of a game engine stock.\n\nSame 3 notes \"music\" on repeat makes you want to strangle infants after 5 minutes.\n\nPhysics are meh.\n\nReminds me of old DOS games, just kind of crappy.   \nYou want a nostaligia kick? Play Jill of the jungle, Commander Keen or Jazz Jackrabbit.\n\nThat being said, the game isn't \"horrible\" , they had a decent concept going on.  \n\nIf feel if they patch the game to update the graphics, music and tweak the physics a bit this game would be ok.",
